 evidence in particular they  look for Footprints but don't find any  they also can't find any traces of DNA  hence tired of all the dead ends kyung  decides to ask help from someone who  knows a great deal about the creatures  he is none other than the cult leader  Jung shortly after the two detectives  arrive at a gathering where Jung is  displaying images of people who were  killed by the supernatural monsters he  claims that whenever someone is supposed  to die an angel appears in front of them  and reveals their exact time of death  the only way to avoid their demise is by  living a peaceful life with no sins  involved after the meeting ends kyung  notices his daughter hee Jung there and  realizes that she is also a follower of  the cult group following this the  detectives try to interrogate young but  he only talks about his personal life he  reveals that when he was 20 years old he  wanted to commit the unthinkable but  fortunately when he saw the three  supernatural beings he changed his mind  instantly Jung believes that the  creatures have come to Earth to give  Justice to human beings so when he saw  the creatures for the first time he  formed the new truth group to make  people aware of the creatures however  kyung simply laughs at this and states  that the laws made by humans are  perfectly fine counter-attacking his  argument Jung reminds kyung how his wife  was murdered and how the Killer is still  moving freely to this day meanwhile we  are shown a single mother Park jungja  who returns home after a long day at  work to her surprise her children  welcome her with a birthday cake but as  the entire family is rejoicing at the  moment suddenly an angel-like figure  appears from nowhere and reveals that  Park will die in five days at 3 pm  Park's son who is ready to capture his  mother's reaction accidentally captures  the angel-like figure instead that  birthday cake better be delicious on the  other hand a popular live streamer is  shown he claims to 