 saying I'm at my friends but to  everyone's surprise it is revealed that  she is actually at Jung's apartment  after Jung tells her that she can trust  him hee Jung starts narrating how her  mother was murdered one day when she was  little her mother sent her to deliver  clothes to her father the little girl  easily got distracted and so her mother  decided to go by herself unfortunately  on the way she was killed by a bunch of  bad people in the present hee Jung  mentions that ever since the incident  she has been unable to forgive herself  hearing all this Jung hugs her and  assures her that he and his group will  catch the murderer and provide Justice  meanwhile after learning that someone  has leaked Park's information on the  internet a lawyer named Hai Jin decides  to help she takes Park's children to  safety and sends them away to Canada  elsewhere Jung takes hee-jung to the  criminal who murdered her mother he then  provokes her to do something in order to  take revenge hijung does just that and  starts beating up the man in a fit of  rage she even finishes him off later the  two incinerate the bodies and pay their  respects surprisingly hee Jung who has  just killed someone starts smiling she  seems to be proud of what she just did  the next day the police find the remains  of the man in a charred condition  similar to what the supernatural  creatures have been doing this makes the  general people believe that whatever the  new truth group we're saying is true  together the arrowheads and the members  of the new truth gather outside Park's  house and to demand she confess her sins  before her death some of the arrowheads  also barge into the police station and  attack them demanding to release their  fellow members in the next scene the day  of Park's destined to death finally  arrives we get to know that the  demonstration is not only being  broadcast on the internet but also on  major TV channels a number of VIPs also  arrive at the place wearing masks t