e people  bowed down in respect however the lawyer  Hai Jin and her colleague didn't respond  at all the streamer conveys the secret  to anyone and soon people start noting  to kill the duo Hai Jin gets to know of  this and immediately departs for office  along with her ill mother sadly when she  reaches there leaving her mother in the  parking lot she notices that the office  has been vandalized by the members of  the arrowhead hygiene then tries to call  her colleague for help but gets to know  that he is an even worse condition  apparently the goons have beaten him up  badly realizing that she is the next  Target hygiene runs to the parking lot  only to find her mother being attacked  by the arrowheads after a while they  leave and hygiene immediately rushes her  mother to the hospital sadly it is too  late as she dies before getting any  treatment in the next scene kyung enters  Jung's apartment to find his missing  daughter he doesn't find anyone and  exits the building but just then some  angry goons start attacking him kyung is  almost beaten to a pulp but fortunately  Zhang calls him in the nick of time and  orders everyone to stand down he then  asks hyung to meet him at a nearby  school on the other hand a distraught  hygiene meets a reporter named Pastor  Kim who apparently interviewed Jung 20  years ago the latter is skeptical about  sharing his information but after a lot  of convincing he agrees Pastor Kim then  plays an audio recording which uncovers  a shocking truth apparently when Zhang  was just a kid the same Angel approached  him and revealed that he will die in  exactly 20 years the time will be 10 30  p.m hygiene finds the news very  informative and asks for the recording  however the pastor deletes it meanwhile  kyung arrives at the abandoned school  and finds Jung waiting for him without  wasting any time the latter reveals that  he was met by the angel 20 years ago  however the strange thing is that he  never committed a sin this implies th